msgid "RC Input"
msgstr "RC 输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-acctongodwit-ga1.rst:155
#: c221a1f2225c4399a5f3de69e1320f4c
msgid ""
"RC can be connected to the PPM input. All unidirectional RC protocols are "
"supported."
msgstr "RC 可连接至 PPM 输入，支持所有单向 RC 协议。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-acctongodwit-ga1.rst:157
#: 25ae624c36da4de090963cc2aee7c774
msgid ""
"For DSM/SBUS receivers, connect them to the DSM/SBUS interface which "
"provides dedicated 3.3V and 5V power pins respectively, and check above "
"\"Pinout\" for detailed pin definition."
msgstr ""
"对于 DSM/SBUS 接收机，请连接至 DSM/SBUS 接口，该接口分别提供专用 3.3V 和 5V "
"电源引脚，详细引脚定义请参见上方「引脚定义」部分。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-acctongodwit-ga1.rst:159
#: 62ed4d2395444ab89cd6af8c3bcc1b12
msgid ""
"For bi-directional protocols a UART whose ``SERIALx_PROTOCOL`` is set to "
"\"23\" is required to be used and connection to the UART's TX pin, refer to "
"the :ref:`ArduPilot Radio Control System documentation <common-rc-systems>` "
"for details."
msgstr ""
"对于双向协议，需要使用 ``SERIALx_PROTOCOL`` 设为「23」的 UART，并连接至该 UART 的 TX 引脚，详情请参阅 "
":ref:`ArduPilot 遥控系统文档 <common-rc-systems>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-acctongodwit-ga1.rst:165
#: 2d82586f522f482bba3d38e00d93cc68
msgid "GPS/Compass"
msgstr "GPS/罗盘"

#: ../../source/docs/common-acctongodwit-ga1.rst:166
#: 2635553d985b4b43914a9b04e696e0f1
msgid ""
"The Godwit G-A1 has a built-in compass. Due to potential interference, the "
"autopilot is usually used with an external I2C compass as part of a "
"GPS/Compass combination."
msgstr "Godwit G-A1 内置罗盘。由于潜在干扰，飞控通常配合 GPS/罗盘组合中的外部 I2C 罗盘使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-acctongodwit-ga1.rst:172
#: 1031b5ea6ed34e9fbe6bca17043dc27b
msgid "Power Connection and Battery Monitor"
msgstr "电源连接和电池监测"

#: ../../source/docs/common-acctongodwit-ga1.rst:173
#: 9b57332560bf4bbbb77bb8d3f2227887
msgid ""
"This autopilot features a CAN PMU module that supports 3 to 14s lithium "
"batteries. To ensure proper connection, attach the module's 6-pin connector "
"to the flight control Power C1 or Power C2 interface. Two additional power "
"module connectors are also supplied if connection to an I2C based module is "
"desired."
msgstr ""
"该飞控配备一个支持 3 至 14S 锂电池的 CAN PMU 模块。为确保正确连接，请将模块的 6 针连接器接至飞控的 Power C1 或 Power"
" C2 接口。如需连接 I2C 电源模块，还提供了两个额外的电源模块连接器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-acctongodwit-ga1.rst:175
#: a91c7d1aced84d968c2f9d98bb8b394f
msgid ""
"This autopilot does not provide power to the servos. To power them, an "
"external BEC must be connected to the positive and negative terminals of any"
" A1-A8 or M1-M8 port."
msgstr "该飞控不为舵机提供电源。如需为舵机供电，必须将外部 BEC 连接至任意 A1-A8 或 M1-M8 接口的正负极。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-acctongodwit-ga1.rst:180
#: a5470aeb221a4096958ad819f92e49ec
msgid "The autopilot defaults are setup to DroneCAN BatteryInfo:"
msgstr "飞控默认设置为 DroneCAN BatteryInfo："

