"The SD card is NOT included in the package, you need to prepare the SD card "
"and insert it into the slot."
msgstr "SD 卡不包含在包装内，需自行准备并插入卡槽。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-acctongodwit-ga1.rst:196
#: c1635bfc7d16405bab112187d6e791a2
msgid "Firmware"
msgstr "固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-acctongodwit-ga1.rst:197
#: 08b9021eac2f424f9515b9ca94b286e5
msgid ""
"The autopilot is shipped with ArduPilot firmware. To upgrade firmware use "
"any ArduPilot GCS.  Firmware for the Godwit G-A1 is located in folders "
"labeled \"AcctonGodwit_GA1\" on the `ArduPilot firmware server "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/>`_"
msgstr ""
"飞控出厂已预装 ArduPilot 固件。如需升级固件，请使用任意 ArduPilot GCS。Godwit G-A1 的固件位于 `ArduPilot"
" 固件服务器 <https://firmware.ardupilot.org/>`_ 标记为「AcctonGodwit_GA1」的目录中。"

